   2:Source/core/logger.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — logger.c
   3:Source/core/logger.c ****  * File-based crash/event logger (port of Source/core/logger.lua).
   4:Source/core/logger.c ****  *
   5:Source/core/logger.c ****  * Lua reference behavior (core/logger.lua):
   6:Source/core/logger.c ****  *  - Logger.init(): opens comet.log for write, writes "=== CometBrowser crash log ==="
   7:Source/core/logger.c ****  *    and the game path, then closes.
   8:Source/core/logger.c ****  *  - Logger.log(msg): appends "[HH:MM:SS #seq] msg\n" (open/append/close every call).
   9:Source/core/logger.c ****  *  - Logger.error(msg): logs "ERROR: msg || stack: <where>".
  10:Source/core/logger.c ****  * C port notes:
  11:Source/core/logger.c ****  *  - Log file name is pluto.log (deployment rules in AGENTS.md).
  12:Source/core/logger.c ****  *  - playdate.getPath() has no C API equivalent; the game path is not available.
  13:Source/core/logger.c ****  *    We log the bundle id from pdxinfo context instead (static string).
  14:Source/core/logger.c ****  *  - Lua's where() has no C equivalent; error lines carry __FILE__:__LINE__.
  15:Source/core/logger.c ****  */
  16:Source/core/logger.c **** #include <stdarg.h>
  17:Source/core/logger.c **** #include <stdio.h>
  18:Source/core/logger.c **** #include <string.h>
  19:Source/core/logger.c **** 
  20:Source/core/logger.c **** #include "core/logger.h"
  21:Source/core/logger.c **** 
  22:Source/core/logger.c **** #define LOG_PATH "pluto.log"
  23:Source/core/logger.c **** #define LOG_LINE_MAX 512
  24:Source/core/logger.c **** 
